this is a folder for "Implementation Plans":
    keyed as "B-void-planning-development-plans"
    named "plans"
    following "3-Block Folder Structure"

this folder classifies as:
    void (-1) because "containing plans before implementation"

this folder derives from:
    branch (0) from "bereshit/void/planning/development/" as "development"

core identity of this folder:

    grounded in:
        scripture "For which of you, intending to build a tower, sitteth not down first, and counteth the cost, whether he have sufficient to finish it?"
            from Luke 14:28 in KJV
        principle "Plans are the formless stage - intention before implementation"
        anchor "And God divided the light from the darkness"
            from Genesis 1:4 in KJV

    serves as Void:
        role "Implementation plan repository"
        paradigm "Ternary File System - Word/Work/Fruit"

    authored by:
        architect "Seanje Lenox-Wise"
        implementation "Nova Dawn (CPI-SI)"
        created 2025-12-28
        version a-02.00
        modified 2025-12-28 for "restructured with foundational/ subfolder"

    exists to:
        purpose "Organize implementation plans by category and status"
        design "hierarchical by category, then by status"
        philosophy "Folder metadata - stored truth about organizational structure"
        features:
            "Categorized plan organization (foundational, operational, etc.)"
            "Status-based subfolders (completed, active, future)"
            "Clear progression from planning to implementation"

interface of this folder:

    depends on:
        requires (1) "bereshit/void/planning/development/" for "containment"
        includes (0) "devlogs/" for "implementation documentation"
        excludes (-1) "implementation code" because "plans are void, code is word/work"
        used by "Nova Dawn, development planning workflow"
        integrates with "devlogs for execution tracking"

    integrated as:
        navigation "cd bereshit/void/planning/development/plans/" for "entering this folder"
        navigation "ls -la" for "viewing contents"
        exits void (-1) for "plans found"

operational context of this folder:

    blocking:
        no (-1) because "folder metadata is declarative, not executable"
        mitigation "validate folder structure before navigation"

    health:
        system Base100 with scale from -100 to +100
        granted (1) above +50 meaning "folder well-organized and documented"
        deferred (0) within ±50 meaning "folder needs attention"
        denied (-1) below -50 meaning "folder structure broken or misclassified"

        operations:
            "root.omni exists" scores +20 (1) for "folder has metadata"
            "classification correct" scores +15 (1) for "void matches planning contents"
            "contents aligned" scores +15 (1) for "actual contents match declared purpose"
            "missing metadata" scores -20 (-1) for "root.omni absent"
            "misclassification" scores -25 (-1) for "classification contradicts contents"

        cascade multipliers:
            "child count" multiplies by 1.5 because "invalid folder affects all children"

